  "description": "The building at 6, Bell Yard is used as the commercial headquarters of The Booksellers Association and associated business groups. The building usage is workplace and this is not expected to change as part of the proposed works. The applicant seeks to remove the existing mechanical plant to the roof of the building as the equipment is now ineffective and has passed its effective lifespan. A series of new mechanical installations are proposed for the roof to support a wholesale refurbishment of the building to create a more contemporary and fit for purpose workspace for the Applicant. Acoustic screens are also proposed to be installed around the plant to mitigate any noise that could affect adjacent properties. Refer also to the covering letter for further information. ",
